OL,3,ADeal with EU not dependent on tuition
OL,4,Afees agreement, Miliband says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deal agreed between the UK and the
OL,7,FEuropean Union on Friday will come into
OL,8,Fforce regardless of whether the two
OL,9,Fsides can negotiate a separate tuition
OL,10,Ffees agreement, Foreign Secretary Ed
OL,11,FMiliband has told the BBC.
OL,13,FThe measures agreed in Brussels include
OL,14,Fscrapping most checks on British food
OL,15,Fexports in return for the UK following
OL,16,Fsome EU regulations from 2028, and a
OL,17,Fnew youth mobility scheme.
OL,19,FHowever, a proposal from the bloc to
OL,20,Flower the level of tuition fees paid by
OL,21,FEU students in the UK has not been
OL,22,Fagreed.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
