OL,3,AAttempted murder charge over councillor
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith attempted murder after a Bradford
OL,8,Fcouncillor was seriously injured in a
OL,9,Fstabbing.
OL,11,FCouncillor Ibrar Ali was attacked at
OL,12,Fabout 11:00 GMT on Thursday on
OL,13,FThornbury Avenue, before being driven
OL,14,Fto nearby Manse Street, according to
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
