OL,3,AFBI reportedly investigating apparent
OL,4,Ahack of its criminal database
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis comes after string of tech outages
OL,7,Fwhich hit banking, air traffic control
OL,8,Fand other sectors in the US last week.
OL,9,FOfficials have said they were not
OL,10,Fcaused by cyberattacks - but the
OL,11,Fblackouts have sparked scrutiny from
OL,12,Flawmakers.
OL,14,FWhite House National Cyber Director
OL,15,FSean Cairncross was fired this week,
OL,16,Fwith US President Donald Trump saying
OL,17,Fhe was not good enough.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
